note SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT OR GPL-2.0-only
note mqget: read and check one message from GSP's status queue.
note statq: the 256 KiB status queue GSP writes (same header shape as the command queue, see mqput).
note rd: our read pointer (kept in our command queue at offset 32, SWAP_RX); wr: GSP's write pointer,
note read by the kernel with READ_ONCE followed by a read fence before this call, so no slot is read
note before the pointer that covers it. out receives the message: header, payload, zeros to a multiple
note of 8. After a positive result the kernel fences and stores (rd + result) mod 63 as our read pointer.
note Checks, as aienux c9678d7b gsp_mq_recv (oracle, tests/host/parity_mq.c): header shape (version 0,
note size 262144, msgSize 4096, msgCount 63, rxHdrOff 32 or more, entryOff 4096), pointers below 63,
note elemCount 1..16 and not past wr, RPC length 32..elements, checksum over the rounded length is 0,
note seqNum equals rxseq, signature "VRPC" (1129337430).
note Result: elements consumed (1..16), 0 when the queue is empty, or 1000000 plus: 1 header shape,
note 2 ring pointer, 3 element count, 4 RPC length, 5 checksum, 6 sequence number, 7 signature.
fn rd32 m view uchar 262144 o ulong to ulong
a = or ulong get m o shl ulong get m add o 1 8
b = or shl ulong get m add o 2 16 shl ulong get m add o 3 24
ret or a b
end
fn ro32 m view uchar 65536 o ulong to ulong
a = or ulong get m o shl ulong get m add o 1 8
b = or shl ulong get m add o 2 16 shl ulong get m add o 3 24
ret or a b
end
fn hdrok s view uchar 262144 to bool
if ne rd32 s 0 0
ret false
end
if ne rd32 s 4 262144
ret false
end
if ne rd32 s 8 4096
ret false
end
if ne rd32 s 12 63
ret false
end
if lt rd32 s 24 32
ret false
end
ret eq rd32 s 28 4096
end
fn cksum m view uchar 65536 n ulong to ulong
x = ulong 0
o = ulong 0
while lt o n bound 8192
w = ulong 0
for k ulong 8
w = or w shl ulong get m add o k mul k 8
end
x = xor x w
o = add o 8
end
ret xor shr x 32 and x 4294967295
end
fn soff rd ulong b ulong to ulong
slot = rem add rd div b 4096 63
ret add add 4096 mul slot 4096 rem b 4096
end
fn cpout s view uchar 262144 out edit uchar 65536 rd ulong mlen ulong to void
up8 = and add mlen 7 18446744073709551608
for b ulong up8
v = uchar 0
if lt b mlen
v = get s soff rd b
end
put out b v
end
end
fn agpu_mq_get s view uchar 262144 out edit uchar 65536 rd ulong wr ulong rxseq ulong to ulong
if not hdrok s
ret 1000001
end
if or ge wr 63 ge rd 63
ret 1000002
end
avail = rem sub add wr 63 rd 63
if eq avail 0
ret 0
end
first = add 4096 mul rd 4096
elems = rd32 s add first 40
rlen = rd32 s add first 56
if or or eq elems 0 gt elems avail gt elems 16
ret 1000003
end
if or lt rlen 32 gt add 48 rlen mul elems 4096
ret 1000004
end
mlen = add 48 rlen
cpout s out rd mlen
if ne cksum out and add mlen 7 18446744073709551608 0
ret 1000005
end
if ne ro32 out 36 rxseq
ret 1000006
end
if ne ro32 out 52 1129337430
ret 1000007
end
ret elems
end
